{"server":"en","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-01_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-01","title":"Meeting","storyCode":"3-1","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_end.txt","sourceHash":"675dd4a76707496805e977127af0d6cf20e033e964448506e46950769d4bfb9e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Speak."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Most of Reunion's forces have retreated already."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Madam Ch'en, we're also done here."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Tsk..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"About those Reunion suspects that we rounded up a few days ago..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Have we been able to get any information out of them?"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_21_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Suspect","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Does this crossbow look familiar to you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Suspect","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"You're able to draw it, aren't you?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"What's the structure of the ammunition? How does it work?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"What were you doing in the slums?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"What were you doing in Lungmen?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Suspect","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"...Nothing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"They won't say a word."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Or perhaps... they just don't know anything."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Like the other Reunion members we defeated, they're probably nothing more than obedient puppets."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"...Make them speak."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Use any methods necessary."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I want to know about their squads, their leadership, their strategies, where they're from, and what they plan to do..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Get everything out of them that you can."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"I want everything I can get."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Report back to me right away, no matter how insignificant it might seem."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Roger!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Has the L.G.D. ever arrested Reunion members before?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't say for sure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"In the end, it's just speculation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Get me in touch with Hoshiguma!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"How's the Special Operations Division faring?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Are they still being overwhelmed by a single Infected?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion seems to have pulled back on their end as well."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"L.G.D. Agent","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"Inspector Hoshiguma is worried about a possible trap and is trying to rule out all risks..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph... Just a single person..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Who the hell do they think they are, coming and going like that?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"You should already know what your next mission is going to be, Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We're going to get Misha back?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Correct."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"This will be the joint operation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"The L.G.D. will take the lead, while Rhodes Island will be in charge of recon and the assault."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ch'en","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"Your mission is complete as long as you can stall Reunion's retreat."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"If we're looking for the enemy... won't we also risk being discovered?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"Right now, we also don't have enough support for our recon squad..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Franka","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't do this on our own."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We should leave this to the professionals."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Franka, help me get in touch with Penguin Logistics."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We're going to need another favor from Exusiai and Texas."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["Ch'en"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["L.G.D. Agent"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["Franka"]}]}
